---
title: Books — Kenneth Granberry
description: A single project, pursued across three books on formation, the examined life, and the defense of what makes us human.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block styles %}
<style>
  .book{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:24px;
    padding:38px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule-light);
  }
  .book:last-of-type{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-light);}
  .book .ord{
    font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
    font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--star);
    padding-top:.55rem;letter-spacing:.04em;
  }
  .book h3{
    font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.6vw,2.05rem);
    line-height:1.12;color:var(--ink);
  }
  .book .sub{
    font-style:italic;color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:1.02rem;margin-top:4px;
  }
  .book .blurb{margin-top:14px;max-width:60ch;color:#3C3E46;}
  .book .status{
    margin-top:16px;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;
    text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--star);
  }
  .book.lead h3{font-size:clamp(1.85rem,3.2vw,2.5rem);}
  .book.lead .status{color:var(--ink);}
  .book.lead .status .pin{color:var(--star);}
  /* Universal buy-links — placeholder until the books are for sale. */
  .buylinks{margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .buylinks .soon{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mist-dim);}
  @media (max-width:600px){ .book{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;} .book .ord{padding-top:0;} }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">The Books <span style="color:var(--mist-dim)">· Forthcoming</span></span>
    <h1>A single project, pursued across three books.</h1>
    <p class="sub">One conviction holds them together: the deepest human capacities are formed, not given — and an age that forgets how to form them will not keep them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-body">
  <div class="wrap">

    <article class="book lead">
      <div class="ord">I</div>
      <div>
        <h3>The Mirrored Mind</h3>
        <div class="sub">A Modern Prophecy and the Road to Redemption</div>
        <p class="blurb">Plato's cave, the Socratic method, and the Logos, brought to bear on the most powerful cognitive tool ever built — a mirror that returns to each mind a magnified version of whatever that mind brings to it.</p>
        <div class="status"><span class="pin">●</span>&nbsp; The flagship · in preparation</div>
        <div class="buylinks"><span class="soon">Buy links to come</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="book">
      <div class="ord">II</div>
      <div>
        <h3>The Center That Cannot Be Empty</h3>
        <div class="sub">Culture, the Sacred, and the Experiment of Our Age</div>
        <p class="blurb">Whether a civilization can keep what it values after quietly discarding the thing those values were first arranged around. An audit, not a sermon — it stops exactly where the evidence does.</p>
        <div class="status">Forthcoming</div>
        <div class="buylinks"><span class="soon">Buy links to come</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="book">
      <div class="ord">III</div>
      <div>
        <h3>What the Mirror Does Not See</h3>
        <div class="sub">On the Epistemic Opacity of AI and the Sovereignty of the Formed Mind</div>
        <p class="blurb">The model cannot read its own ground; the formed mind can. A case for the authority that formation — and only formation — confers in the encounter with a machine that knows everything and discerns nothing.</p>
        <div class="status">Forthcoming</div>
        <div class="buylinks"><span class="soon">Buy links to come</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    {#
      FUTURE ENTRY — "The AI Entrepreneur's Blueprint" (with Nicholas Granberry)
      will slot in here as an additional title once its presentation on the
      literary hub is decided. Its commercial landing page can remain a
      separate property linked from this entry.
    #}

  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
